From d72413c886f64cb65469307b4c0fc18a96c9cfc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:40:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Five rebuilt guides: Garden City, Little River, Myrtle Beach,
 Pawleys Island, and the common mistakes buyers make

- /submarkets/garden-city/: the pier, the county line on the beach, which side floods, condo dues and what a rental condo keeps.
- /submarkets/little-river/: the parts of town and what each gives you, the harbor and its boat slips, prices by subdivision.
- /submarkets/myrtle-beach/: the city's parts, where houses resell near the middle price, the oceanfront condo buildings and which loans they take.
- /submarkets/pawleys-island/: the island and the mainland, winter there, the shops, restaurants and the state park, the rental season.
- /buyers/common-mistakes/: the mistakes buyers make here, each with the local fact behind it.
- Each page from a verified fact ledger (batch 2026-11-a), charts built from data files. llms.txt entries for the five pages rewritten; dates and llms-full.txt rebuilt.
