 # The Myrtle Beach buyer mistakes that cost the most.
-By Devin Day , Operations Officer · Chapter3 Realty · Updated November 1, 2026
 
-The Myrtle Beach mistakes that cost buyers the most: flood zones, HOA rules, condo litigation, and Airbnb math, each checked for you before you make an offer.
