ar(--brass-2);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Chapter3 Realty &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated October 4, 2026</span></p></div><div style="background:rgba(244,239,232,.06);border:1px solid rgba(244,239,232,.14);border-radius:12px;padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;align-self:start"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass-2);margin-bottom:1.1rem">At a glance</p><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.85rem"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,239,232,.1);padding-bottom:.75rem"><span style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.55);font-size:.85rem">Primary strategy</span><span style="color:var(--ivory);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;text-align:right">Short-term rental</span></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,239,232,.1);padding-bottom:.75rem"><span style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.55);font-size:.85rem">Core inventory</span><span style="color:var(--ivory);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;text-align:right">Oceanfront condos</span></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,239,232,.1);padding-bottom:.75rem"><span style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.55);font-size:.85rem">Beach access</span><span style="color:var(--ivory);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;text-align:right">Direct oceanfront</span></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,239,232,.1);padding-bottom:.75rem"><span style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.55);font-size:.85rem">STR regulation</span><span style="color:var(--ivory);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;text-align:right">Permitted by zone</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>
