+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-2722.</span> Exemptions from the motor vehicle tax.<br /><br />
+	This article does not apply to motor vehicles on which is used a research and development license plate issued by the department pursuant to Section 56-3-2335.<br /><br />
+HISTORY: 1994 Act No. 497, Part II, SECTION 84B.<br /><br />
+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-2723.</span> Article inapplicable to vehicles operated on highway with manufacturer&#39;s plates.<br /><br />
